  "description": "The project is called **awesome_app** and it is set up to use Material Design throughout the UI. Its bundled assets include the logo image at `assets/images/logo.png` and a configuration file at `assets/data/config.json`. The application relies on two backend services: **firebase_analytics** and **cloud_firestore**. For typography, the app ships with the **Roboto** font family, providing three font files: `fonts/Roboto-Regular.ttf` (weight\u202f400, normal style), `fonts/Roboto-Bold.ttf` (weight\u202f700, normal style), and `fonts/Roboto-Italic.ttf` (weight\u202f400, italic style).\n\nThe Flutter module is configured for AndroidX and uses the Android package identifier `com.example.awesomeapp` as well as the iOS bundle identifier `com.example.awesomeapp`. The plugin section defines platform\u2011specific implementations: on Android the plugin class is **AwesomePlugin** in the package `com.example.awesomeapp.plugin`; on iOS the plugin class is also **AwesomePlugin** with an iOS prefix of **AwesomeIOS**. The Linux build registers **AwesomeLinuxPlugin** with the Dart counterpart **AwesomeLinuxDartPlugin**; the macOS build registers **AwesomeMacosPlugin** with Dart class **AwesomeMacosDartPlugin** (macOS prefix **AwesomeMacos**); and the Windows build registers **AwesomeWindowsPlugin** with Dart class **AwesomeWindowsDartPlugin**. The top\u2011level plugin settings repeat the Android package `com.example.awesomeapp.plugin` and the generic plugin class **AwesomePlugin**.",
  "reference_json": {
    "name": "awesome_app",
    "flutter": {
      "uses-material-design": true,
      "assets": [
        "assets/images/logo.png",
        "assets/data/config.json"
      ],
      "services": [
        "firebase_analytics",
        "cloud_firestore"
      ],
      "fonts": [
        {
          "family": "Roboto",
          "fonts": [
            {
              "asset": "fonts/Roboto-Regular.ttf",
              "weight": 400,
              "style": "normal"
            },
            {
              "asset": "fonts/Roboto-Bold.ttf",
              "weight": 700,
              "style": "normal"
            },
            {
              "asset": "fonts/Roboto-Italic.ttf",
              "weight": 400,
              "style": "italic"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "module": {
        "androidX": true,
        "androidPackage": "com.example.awesomeapp",
        "iosBundleIdentifier": "com.example.awesomeapp"
      },
      "plugin": {
        "platforms": {
          "android": {
            "package": "com.example.awesomeapp.plugin",
            "pluginClass": "AwesomePlugin"
          },
          "ios": {
            "pluginClass": "AwesomePlugin"
          },
          "linux": {
            "pluginClass": "AwesomeLinuxPlugin",
            "dartPluginClass": "AwesomeLinuxDartPlugin"
          },
          "macos": {
            "pluginClass": "AwesomeMacosPlugin",
            "dartPluginClass": "AwesomeMacosDartPlugin"
          },
          "windows": {
            "pluginClass": "AwesomeWindowsPlugin",
            "dartPluginClass": "AwesomeWindowsDartPlugin"
          }
        },
        "androidPackage": "com.example.awesomeapp.plugin",
        "iosPrefix": "AwesomeIOS",
        "macosPrefix": "AwesomeMacos",
        "pluginClass": "AwesomePlugin"
      }
    }
  }
